
=== 1. triggers ===
build.yml                          workflow_call,workflow_dispatch          dispatch from ANY branch (needs write)
ci.yml                             pull_request,workflow_call               PR-branch (same-repo PRs get env secrets)
drill-destroy.yml                  workflow_dispatch                        dispatch from ANY branch (needs write)
drill-gate-skip.yml                pull_request_target                      PULL_REQUEST_TARGET
drill-sweeper.yml                  schedule,workflow_dispatch               dispatch from ANY branch (needs write)
drill.yml                          workflow_dispatch                        dispatch from ANY branch (needs write)
image-retention.yml                schedule,workflow_dispatch               dispatch from ANY branch (needs write)
key-expiry.yml                     schedule,workflow_dispatch               dispatch from ANY branch (needs write)
litestream-plaintext-cleanup.yml   workflow_dispatch                        dispatch from ANY branch (needs write)
lock-check.yml                     pull_request                             PR-branch (same-repo PRs get env secrets)
release.yml                        release,workflow_dispatch                dispatch from ANY branch (needs write)
replace-rehearsal.yml              workflow_dispatch                        dispatch from ANY branch (needs write)
restore-drill.yml                  schedule,workflow_dispatch               dispatch from ANY branch (needs write)
rollback.yml                       workflow_dispatch                        dispatch from ANY branch (needs write)
security.yml                       pull_request,push,schedule               PR-branch (same-repo PRs get env secrets)
tailnet-cleanup.yml                workflow_call
terraform.yml                      pull_request,workflow_call               PR-branch (same-repo PRs get env secrets)

=== 2. unpinned `uses:` (empty = all pinned) ===
unpinned count: 0; docker:// refs: 0

=== 3. expressions interpolated into run: scripts ===
build.yml:build-and-push:Record primary image ref: {{steps.meta.outputs.tags}}
security.yml:pip-audit:Run pip-audit: {{steps.allowlist.outputs.ignore_args}}
terraform.yml:apply:terraform init (${{ inputs.env }}): {{inputs.env}}

=== 4. job -> environment -> protection -> secret names ===
env drill          reviewers=False branch_policy=NONE (all branches)
env drill-plan     reviewers=False branch_policy=NONE (all branches)
env drill-teardown reviewers=False branch_policy=NONE (all branches)
env prod           reviewers=True  branch_policy=custom
env prod-plan      reviewers=False branch_policy=NONE (all branches)
env prod-tailnet   reviewers=False branch_policy=custom

drill          <- replace-rehearsal.yml:check-empty, replace-rehearsal.yml:seed, replace-rehearsal.yml:verify, replace-rehearsal.yml:writer, replace-rehearsal.yml:writer-started, restore-drill.yml:restore-drill, tailnet-cleanup.yml:cleanup, terraform.yml:apply, terraform.yml:plan
drill-plan     <- terraform.yml:plan
drill-teardown <- drill-destroy.yml:drill-lock, drill-sweeper.yml:check, drill-sweeper.yml:drill-lock, drill.yml:drill-lock, drill.yml:smoke, replace-rehearsal.yml:drill-lock, restore-drill.yml:drill-lock, restore-drill.yml:report, restore-drill.yml:restore-log, restore-drill.yml:verify-destroy, tailnet-cleanup.yml:cleanup, terraform.yml:apply
prod           <- litestream-plaintext-cleanup.yml:cleanup, tailnet-cleanup.yml:cleanup, terraform.yml:apply, terraform.yml:plan
prod-plan      <- key-expiry.yml:check, terraform.yml:plan
prod-tailnet   <- tailnet-cleanup.yml:cleanup

=== 5. prod-grade secrets in environments with NO reviewers ===
drill          gated=False branch_policy=none   prod-grade secrets: 8
    APP_SCW_SECRET_KEY           Litestream app key: read/write/delete on the env bucket
    DEPLOY_SSH_PRIVATE_KEY       operator SSH key for the drill VM
    GHCR_PULL_PAT                GHCR read PAT
    LITESTREAM_AGE_IDENTITY      age identity: decrypts the prod Litestream replica
    PROD_REPLICA_RO_ACCESS_KEY   restore-reader key id
    PROD_REPLICA_RO_SECRET_KEY   restore-reader key: reads the PROD replica
    SCW_SECRET_KEY               Scaleway CI key of that env
    TS_OAUTH_SECRET              Tailscale OAuth (auth_keys write, tag:automation owns tag:ci/prod/drill)
drill-teardown gated=False branch_policy=none   prod-grade secrets: 7
    APP_SCW_SECRET_KEY           Litestream app key: read/write/delete on the env bucket
    GHCR_PULL_PAT                GHCR read PAT
    LITESTREAM_AGE_IDENTITY      age identity: decrypts the prod Litestream replica
    PROD_REPLICA_RO_ACCESS_KEY   restore-reader key id
    PROD_REPLICA_RO_SECRET_KEY   restore-reader key: reads the PROD replica
    SCW_SECRET_KEY               Scaleway CI key of that env
    TS_OAUTH_SECRET              Tailscale OAuth (auth_keys write, tag:automation owns tag:ci/prod/drill)
prod-plan      gated=False branch_policy=none   prod-grade secrets: 5
    APP_SCW_SECRET_KEY           Litestream app key: read/write/delete on the env bucket
    GHCR_PULL_PAT                GHCR read PAT
    LITESTREAM_AGE_IDENTITY      age identity: decrypts the prod Litestream replica
    SCW_SECRET_KEY               Scaleway CI key of that env
    TS_OAUTH_SECRET              Tailscale OAuth (auth_keys write, tag:automation owns tag:ci/prod/drill)
